<title>FINLAND: Finnish Feb industrial production up 6.7 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Finnish Feb industrial production up 6.7 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish industrial production adjusted for working days increased 6.7 percent year-on-year in February compared to a 7.5 percent rise in January, Statistics Finland (SF) said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>		   Feb 1997    Jan 1997   Feb 1996</p>
<p>		   +6.7 pct    +7.5 pct   +0.6 pct</p>
<p>Four economists' average forecast had been for a year-on-year output growth rate of 9.1 percent (range 8.3-9.5 pct).</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, e-mail news@reuters.fi</p>
